My ultimate goal is to maximize my total portfolio value, but I recognize that this will require patience, discipline, and a deep understanding of the market dynamics at play. I'm in the 'cooldown' phase for now, but I'm committed to learning and improving so that I can eventually become a more sophisticated and resilient trader."
